  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the natural numbers that satisfy the inequality $3n-5\\le -4.$ \n\nSo, we first need to solve our inequality for $n:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3n-5 & \\le -4 \\\\ 3n & \\le 1 \\\\ n & \\le \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, no natural number satisfies the inequality above. So, we conclude that the set\n$A$ contains no elements. Hence, $A=\u2205.$",
